# Baton — bench apply report · Cursor's verbatim account of what landed
# Invariant: reported verbatim · pin what the bench reports · exit codes captured before any pipe
kind baton
name bench_apply_report
carrier bench
crosses bench_to_counsel
status exact
# event · apply stamp · new tip
field header
# pack exit and elapsed
field pack
# every green named with its proof phrase
field greens
# every red with three fields — wrong · caught · taught
field reds
# meters delta against the pinned values
field meters_delta
# the pins the next session stands on
field pins
# the door board — open rulings awaiting Keaton's word, when doors stand
field doors
# the named next motion
field next
